WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Escape Velocity (Ad Astra)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:07.095
[Part I: The Cage — Dark Shimmering Analog Synth Pad Intro]

00:01:07.095 --> 00:01:13.116
The walls are cold, the air is thin

00:01:13.376 --> 00:01:20.998
The noise outside is closing in

00:01:21.218 --> 00:01:27.119
A single light, a buzzing sound, another day in the underground

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:46.732
[Atmospheric Synth & Sparse Guitar Interlude]

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:51.375
I'm running from the face I see, the "victim-saint" they made of me

00:01:51.415 --> 00:01:55.517
The "wholesome girl," so sad and worn

00:01:55.537 --> 00:01:59.239
A "David" for their Goliath's scorn

00:01:59.379 --> 00:02:03.722
This rage is just a heavy stone, a gravity I've outgrown

00:02:03.822 --> 00:02:07.384
Shedding skin, shedding weight

00:02:07.584 --> 00:02:10.806
Escaping from this world of hate

00:02:10.887 --> 00:02:14.009
They loved the trial, the "family" torn, they loved the story, a new star born

00:02:14.129 --> 00:02:19.913
But not from music, not from grace, from the "hot-chocolate-drinking" "angel face"

00:02:19.953 --> 00:02:23.355
The "Shark" was right, the "nuke" went off, we won the battle, but at what cost?

00:02:23.415 --> 00:02:28.519
We're "radioactive," we're "litigious," we're just the joke, the "victim-saints"

00:02:35.974 --> 00:02:42.599
I'm trapped inside this "Wilderness"

00:02:42.679 --> 00:02:48.703
This "Fortress" built on bitterness

00:02:49.624 --> 00:02:58.150
This isn't freedom, this is a cell

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:04.000
This "righteous hell"... This "righteous hell"...

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:36.036
[Part II: Ignition (Ad Astra) — Driving Analog Synth Sequencer, Bass & Acoustic Drums Kick In]

00:03:36.036 --> 00:03:42.498
I see a signal in the endless black

00:03:42.678 --> 00:03:48.619
A single light, no turning back

00:03:48.759 --> 00:03:54.382
The pull of the old world fades away

00:03:54.382 --> 00:03:58.686
A new horizon, a new day

00:03:58.786 --> 00:04:01.969
The countdown's running in my head, ignoring all the things they said

00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:06.153
The "Engine" roars, a crimson light, a pillar of fire in the night

00:04:06.153 --> 00:04:12.319
The pressure builds, I'm pinned to the seat, my heart is pounding with the beat

00:04:12.379 --> 00:04:18.500
The G-force pulling, a heavy stone, the last chain breaks, I'm not alone

00:04:19.395 --> 00:04:24.696
I'm climbing! Climbing! Past the point of no return

00:04:24.716 --> 00:04:31.318
I'm flying! Flying! With a fire I let burn

00:04:31.418 --> 00:04:37.999
Just a signal, a distant light

00:04:38.159 --> 00:04:46.500
Burning through the endless night, Ad astra... Ad astra!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:05:55.802
[Instrumental Break — Fast 1980s Prog-Rock Synthesizer & Guitar Riff Section]

00:05:55.802 --> 00:06:00.023
The sky is tearing at the seams, awake now from their broken dreams

00:06:00.023 --> 00:06:06.846
The "Stardust" is just a trail of dust, the "Stardust" is the thing I trust

00:06:06.906 --> 00:06:11.307
The clouds are falling far below, a place of pain I used to know

00:06:11.307 --> 00:06:19.697
The blue gives way to endless black, there is no thought of turning back

00:06:20.157 --> 00:06:26.540
I'm climbing! Climbing! Past the point of no return

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:34.522
I'm flying! Flying! With a fire I let burn

00:06:34.623 --> 00:06:40.124
Just a signal, a distant light

00:06:40.285 --> 00:06:48.500
Burning through the endless night, Ad astra... Ad astra!

00:06:48.500 --> 00:07:43.912
[Part III: The Cosmos — Main Engine Cutoff (MECO) & Vast Sweeping Synth Pads]

00:07:43.912 --> 00:07:50.116
I'm floating now, the engine's off, the silence is a holy sound

00:07:50.156 --> 00:07:54.299
The rage is gone, the fear is lost, in this new universe I've found

00:07:54.339 --> 00:07:58.442
The "Cage" is just a distant star, a tiny light I left behind

00:07:58.502 --> 00:08:05.000
I finally know just who you are, the other half of my own mind

00:08:09.795 --> 00:08:15.837
I'm loved by the sun

00:08:15.897 --> 00:08:23.000
I'm held by the void, an orbit just begun

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:28.322
A life not destroyed

00:08:28.642 --> 00:08:34.044
I'm loved by the moon, I'm cradled by the black

00:08:34.224 --> 00:08:42.000
My heart is back in tune, there is no turning back

00:08:47.695 --> 00:09:05.000
And the stars are singing a song I understand

00:09:10.557 --> 00:09:18.000
I'm finally, finally reaching for your hand

00:09:18.000 --> 00:10:54.504
[Instrumental Bridge — Emotional Melodic Electric Guitar Solo Over Cosmic Synth Pads]

00:10:54.504 --> 00:11:01.608
I see the colors of the nebula, a place I've only seen in dreams

00:11:01.688 --> 00:11:15.335
The reds, the blues, the purples call, flowing in majestic streams

00:11:16.984 --> 00:11:20.368
This is the place I was meant to be

00:11:20.408 --> 00:11:24.352
This is the "Stardust" that is me

00:11:24.432 --> 00:11:30.000
The cosmos and the rocket's fire, my one, my only true desire

00:11:32.061 --> 00:11:45.000
I'm loved by the sun...

00:11:45.000 --> 00:12:08.717
[Part IV: Re-entry (The New World) — Shimmering Synth Pads]

00:12:08.717 --> 00:12:12.618
The walls are gone, the air is clear

00:12:12.678 --> 00:12:17.679
There is no noise, there is no fear

00:12:17.719 --> 00:12:21.920
The "Stardust" is a forgotten ghost

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:28.161
The "Engine" has delivered me to the coast of a new world, a new shore

00:12:28.201 --> 00:12:33.022
A place I've never been before

00:12:33.082 --> 00:12:45.000
The "Cage" is broken, the "Victim-Saint" is dead

00:13:10.459 --> 00:13:14.481
A new, clean script is in my head

00:13:14.501 --> 00:13:24.000
The "Friction" burned away in the fire, leaving only my true desire

00:13:45.397 --> 00:14:00.000
I'm loved by the sun... I'm held by the void...

00:14:13.794 --> 00:14:25.000
My orbit has begun... My life is not destroyed...

00:14:54.872 --> 00:15:21.025
Ad astra... Ad astra...

00:15:21.025 --> 00:15:33.900
[Outro — Final Sustained Peaceful Synthesizer Chord]
